    q: 'Does Qatar charge VAT on top of import duty?',
    a: 'No general VAT is currently applied on Qatar imports. The main statutory charge is 5% customs duty on CIF. This differs from Saudi Arabia and the UAE, which apply VAT on top of duty. Verify the current Qatar position with the General Authority of Customs before finalising a quote.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How can I reduce the landed cost on the China-to-Qatar route?',
    a: 'Consolidate into fewer, fuller containers; compare FCL and LCL all-in quotes; classify the HS code correctly before booking; screen restricted goods early; file the Al-Nadeeb declaration before arrival; book trucking before discharge; and negotiate the destination fee schedule rather than accepting the first quote.',
